Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/gFKlN-P67f0/m/jc9h06fOnacJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Winston,

You need

qplot(color, carat, data=dsmall, colour=cut,
      position=position_jitter(width=.25, height=0)) +

    stat_summary(aes(group = cut), fun.y=mean, geom="line")

See section 4.5.3 of the book for why.

Hadley

